===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|head=[[predicate]] [[calculus]]}}

# {{context|logic|lang=en}} The branch of logic that deals with [[quantified]] [[statement]]s such as "there exists an x such that..." or "for any x, it is the case that...", where x is a [[member]] of the [[domain of discourse]].

